are not. Makes it easy to miss them.<br /> <br /> Top of page 104: Internally, the Jagged Crescent has tentatively reconnected with their fellow factions to share knowledge <b>their</b>.<br /> <br /> On page 128, under Aegis Kai Doru: We <b>doesn\u2019t</b> necessarily hunt demons. From the rest of the statement it doesn't seem like it's just in-character improper grammar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-30-2014, 11:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T15:19:12-07:00","id":122702,"title":"","content":"Just from the preview: Chapter Three is called <i>Ghostwalkers</i> in the table of contents and <i>Eaters of the Dead</i> in the Introduction (p. 11).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T15:41:09-07:00","id":122714,"title":"","content":"Character Sheet on p167 lists 4 beat boxes instead of 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-th