every use of Project or Task Force, such as Project: Fort, or don't. Switching back and forth makes it look a bit sloppy and harder to search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2868-dimitry","name":"Dimitry","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T18:27:21-07:00","id":122820,"title":"","content":"Imp on page 35 has a defense of 6 when it should be 5. Showing Wits 3 and Dex 3 with an Athletics of 2","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T18:29:35-07:00","id":122824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crazy_Ivan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/122566-mortal-remains-errata-thread?p=122721#post122721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tensare Custos has an error in its statblock; Defense is miscalculated as 4 instead of 9 it should be according to the GMC rules. Same with Pearl Lawrence (3 instead of 4).</div> </div> </div> </div> Just an FYI, Tensare Custos is on page 57 while Pearl Lawrence is