avo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T21:38:13-07:00","id":138936,"title":"","content":"Page 158 in Risking Willpower, &quot;Instead it gives two Practical Beats (see p. <b>164</b>.) Practical Experience is on p. 161.<br /> <br /> Speaking of, in Practical Experience (p. 161), it says, &quot;Additionally, note the Practical Beats afforded by risking Willpower (see p. <b>164</b>) ...&quot; Risking Willpower is on p. 158.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Let me answer that question with a headbutt!&quot; ~ Buffy Summers, S4E1","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3029-dark-aleksandr","name":"Dark Aleksandr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3029_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}